BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF DHARMASRAYA,

Considering : a. that women and children have the right to obtain a sense of security and freedom from all forms of torture or treatment that degrades human dignity; b. that women and children are among vulnerable groups who tend to experience violence, therefore need to obtain optimal protection;

