f. being responsible to the Regent through the Deputy Regent; g. formulating Gender Mainstreaming policy recommendations to the Regent;

h. preparing the Regional Gender profile;

i. monitoring the implementation of Gender Mainstreaming in each Regional Apparatus.

j. establishing a technical team to conduct analysis of gender-responsive regional budgets;

